00:03:12.272 --> 00:03:14.083
much like it was the pain the ass for me,

00:03:14.083 --> 00:03:15.929
with Wine Library and Gary Vaynerchuk,

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:19.062
GaryVee, and on Facebook,
when I used to have

00:03:19.062 --> 00:03:22.244
personal pages, before fan pages existed,

00:03:22.244 --> 00:03:24.322
and I maxed out my friends limit.

00:03:24.322 --> 00:03:25.491
That was a humblebrag.

00:03:26.041 --> 00:03:28.527
And yeah, so it's a pain in the butt,

00:03:28.527 --> 00:03:30.211
but I think you should separate the three.

00:03:30.211 --> 00:03:31.787
Instagram has become a safe haven

00:03:31.787 --> 00:03:33.830
